WEBVTT

00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:12.036
An exponent tells how many times to multiply a number by itself: two to the third

00:00:12.036 --> 00:00:16.906
power means two times two times two, which is eight.

00:00:19.706 --> 00:00:26.354
A logarithm asks the reverse question: what exponent makes a given number?

00:00:29.154 --> 00:00:37.002
Since two to the fourth power is sixteen, the logarithm base two of sixteen is four.
